MAIN DIFFERENCES OF HTML AND JSX

1.HTML is a markup language for web pages while .jsx is a syntax for a react extension.
2.HTML is recognized and read by the browser while .jsx need to be transpiled by babel in js that browser can read.
3.HTML can't run scripts while .jsx file can have scripts inside {}
4.HTML uses class, for; JSX uses className, htmlFor.
5.HTML uses strings; JSX can use JS objects for inline styles.
6.HTML has only elements but jsx has custom components.
7.JSX must have a single parent while HTML doesn't do this.